<figure class="range-figure">
 <div class="time-labels"><span></span><span>10:00</span><span>11:00</span><span>12:00</span></div>
 <div class="booking-row"><b>Cedar · 1</b><div><span class="period first">[10:00, 11:00)</span></div></div>
 <div class="booking-row"><b>Cedar · 2</b><div><span class="period second">[11:00, 12:00)</span></div></div>
 <div class="booking-row"><b>Attempt 3</b><div><span class="period overlap">[10:30, 11:30)</span></div></div>
 <figcaption>The accepted Cedar bookings touch at 11:00 but share no instant: each interval includes its start and excludes its end. The attempted third interval shares time with both. Its rejection depends on the same room as well as the overlap.</figcaption>
